BGV DEPLOY-25 (Java Lambda + DynamoDB + S3/CloudFront)
Date: 2026-02-25

This file is the single runbook to deploy the current Java-based backend and frontend.

==================================================
1) PREREQUISITES (one-time)
==================================================
From workspace root: BGV_Final

1. Java 21 + Maven
  - java -version   # Must be Java 21
   - mvn -version

2. Node + npm
   - node --version
   - npm --version

3. AWS CLI + credentials profile
   - aws --version
   - aws configure --profile <AWS_PROFILE>
   - aws sts get-caller-identity --profile <AWS_PROFILE>
  - Note: deploy.js / validate-environment.cmd now auto-detect AWS CLI in standard Windows paths

4. Dependencies install (if not already done)
   - cd Paramount_Project/frontend
   - npm install
   - cd ../infrastructure/cdk
   - npm install
   - cd ../../..

5. Production CDK context (mandatory for prod)
  - Open: Paramount_Project/infrastructure/cdk/cdk.json
  - Set context.prod.frontendDomain to exact HTTPS frontend domain (no wildcard)
  - Set context.prod.cognitoUserPoolArn to your Cognito User Pool ARN
  - Set context.prod.sharepointFolderUrl and context.prod.sharepointEnabled as needed
  - (Recommended) set context.prod.alarmEmail for operational alerts
  - Review alarm and budget thresholds in cdk.json:
    - api5xxAlarmThreshold
    - lambdaErrorAlarmThreshold
    - lambdaThrottleAlarmThreshold
    - lambdaP95DurationMsThreshold
    - monthlyBudgetUsd
  - Example ARN format:
    arn:aws:cognito-idp:us-east-1:123456789012:userpool/us-east-1_xxxxxxxx

==================================================
2) FIRST DEPLOY (new environment)
==================================================
From workspace root: BGV_Final

Command:
  node deploy.js --stage <dev|prod> --profile <AWS_PROFILE> --firstDeploy

Example:
  node deploy.js --stage dev --profile myawsprofile --firstDeploy

What this runs automatically:
  1. scripts/validate-environment.cmd
  2. scripts/deploy-backend.cmd
     - mvn clean package -DskipTests
     - npm run build (CDK)
     - npx cdk deploy BgvServerless<Stage>Stack
  3. scripts/configure-lambda-env-vars.cmd
  4. scripts/initialize-opensearch-indices.cmd (safe if skipped)
  5. scripts/configure-s3-cors.cmd
  6. scripts/configure-cognito-urls.cmd (safe if skipped)
  7. scripts/deploy-frontend.cmd

