==================================================
7) POST-DEPLOY QUICK CHECKS
==================================================
1. Get stack outputs:
   aws cloudformation describe-stacks --stack-name BgvServerlessDevStack --profile <AWS_PROFILE> --query "Stacks[0].Outputs" --output table

2. Validate API is reachable using the API URL from outputs.

3. Open CloudFront URL from outputs and verify frontend loads.

4. Check Lambda logs if required:
  aws logs tail /aws/lambda/bgv-api-dev --follow --profile <AWS_PROFILE>

