9) COMMON FAILURES
==================================================
1. Maven build fails:
   - Run in backend folder: mvn clean package -DskipTests

2. AWS profile invalid:
   - aws configure --profile <AWS_PROFILE>
   - aws sts get-caller-identity --profile <AWS_PROFILE>

3. Validation fails on Java version:
  - Java 21 is required by deployment preflight
  - Check with: java -version

4. CDK deploy fails:
   - cd Paramount_Project/infrastructure/cdk
   - npm install
   - npm run build
   - npx cdk synth

5. Production deploy blocked by security checks:
  - Ensure cdk.json has real values for:
    - context.prod.frontendDomain (must not be *)
    - context.prod.cognitoUserPoolArn

6. SharePoint behavior mismatch:
   - Ensure cdk.json has expected values for:
     - context.<stage>.sharepointFolderUrl
     - context.<stage>.sharepointEnabled

7. No alarm emails received:
  - Set context.<stage>.alarmEmail in cdk.json and redeploy
  - Confirm SNS email subscription from inbox

8. Billing alarm not moving:
  - EstimatedCharges metric is in us-east-1 namespace
  - This stack creates billing alarm against AWS/Billing in us-east-1

Primary recommended deployment command:
  node deploy.js --stage dev --profile <AWS_PROFILE> --firstDeploy